The '''Flaming Worm''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from lava while in the {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Flaming Worm''' can be fished up from any lava source in the {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}} with a Lava [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] if the player has {{Skill|Fishing|XIX}}. The Flaming Worm can only be fished up if the lava source is above Y level {{Green|64}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Flaming Worm''' is {{Green|180}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|100.00%|1|1|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
